Package: uniscript
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: pannous <info@pannous.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.17)
Section: text
Priority: optional
Multi-Arch: foreign
Homepage: https://pannous.com/uniscript/
Description: ASCII names for Unicode text and back
 uniscript converts tags like <:alpha> or <:fracture A> into the Unicode text
 they name (α 𝔄) and, with -r, Unicode text back into tags. It reads its
 arguments, files or standard input.
